    "category": "Python Basics",
    "title": "Strings",
    "content": "<p class=\"text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    Strings are used to store text in Python. A string is a sequence of characters and can contain\n    letters, numbers, symbols, spaces, and other characters.\n</p>\n\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-6 mb-3\">Creating Strings</h2>\n\n<p class=\"mb-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    Strings can be surrounded by either single quotation marks or double quotation marks.\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>print(\"Hello\")\nprint('Hello')</code></pre>\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"mb-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    Single and double quotes can both be used to create strings.\n</p>\n\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-6 mb-3\">Quotes Inside Quotes</h2>\n\n<p class=\"mb-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    You can place quotation marks inside a string as long as the inner quotation mark does not\n    conflict with the quotation marks surrounding the string.\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>print(\"It's alright\")\nprint(\"He is called 'Johnny'\")\nprint('He is called \"Johnny\"')</code></pre>\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-6 mb-3\">Assigning a String to a Variable</h2>\n\n<p class=\"mb-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    A string can be assigned to a variable using the assignment operator <code>=</code>.\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>name = \"Michael\"\n\nprint(name)</code></pre>\n\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-6 mb-3\">Multiline Strings</h2>\n\n<p class=\"mb-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    A multiline string can be created using three single quotes or three double quotes.\n</p>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-4 mb-2\">Three Double Quotes</h3>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>text = \"\"\"Hello\nThis is a\nmultiline string.\"\"\"\n\nprint(text)</code></pre>\n\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-4 mb-2\">Three Single Quotes</h3>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>text = '''Hello\nThis is a\nmultiline string.'''\n\nprint(text)</code></pre>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"my-4 p-4 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 dark:bg-amber-950/40 border-l-4 border-amber-500 text-amber-900 dark:text-amber-200 text-sm\">\n    <strong class=\"font-bold flex items-center gap-1.5 mb-1\">\n        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-lightbulb\"></i> Important:\n    </strong>\n    Line breaks inside a multiline string are preserved when the string is displayed.\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-6 mb-3\">Strings Are Sequences of Characters</h2>\n\n<p class=\"mb-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    Python strings behave like sequences of Unicode characters. Python does not have a separate\n    character type, so a single character is simply a string containing one character.\n</p>\n\n<p class=\"mb-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    Square brackets can be used to access characters using their index.\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>text = \"Hello, World!\"\n\nprint(text[1])</code></pre>\n\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"mb-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    Python starts counting indexes at <code>0</code>.\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>text = \"Hello\"\n\n# H = index 0\n\n# e = index 1\n\n# l = index 2\n\n# l = index 3\n\n# o = index 4</code></pre>\n\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-6 mb-3\">Looping Through a String</h2>\n\n<p class=\"mb-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    Since strings are sequences, a <code>for</code> loop can be used to process each character.\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>for character in \"banana\":\n    print(character)</code></pre>\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-6 mb-3\">String Length</h2>\n\n<p class=\"mb-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    The <code>len()</code> function returns the number of characters in a string.\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>text = \"Hello, World!\"\n\nprint(len(text))</code></pre>\n\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-6 mb-3\">Checking for Text with in</h2>\n\n<p class=\"mb-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    The <code>in</code> keyword checks whether a character or phrase exists inside a string.\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>text = \"The best things in life are free!\"\n\nprint(\"free\" in text)</code></pre>\n\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-4 mb-2\">Using in with if</h3>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>text = \"The best things in life are free!\"\n\nif \"free\" in text:\nprint(\"Yes, 'free' is present.\")</code></pre>\n\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-6 mb-3\">Checking for Text with not in</h2>\n\n<p class=\"mb-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    The <code>not in</code> keyword checks whether a character or phrase is not present in a string.\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>text = \"The best things in life are free!\"\n\nprint(\"expensive\" not in text)</code></pre>\n\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-4 mb-2\">Using not in with if</h3>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>text = \"The best things in life are free!\"\n\nif \"expensive\" not in text:\nprint(\"No, 'expensive' is NOT present.\")</code></pre>\n\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-6 mb-3\">Slicing Strings</h2>\n\n<p class=\"mb-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    Slicing allows you to return a range of characters from a string.\n    The general syntax is <code>string[start:end]</code>.\n</p>\n\n<p class=\"mb-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    The start index is included, but the end index is not included.\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>text = \"Hello, World!\"\n\nprint(text[2:5])</code></pre>\n\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"mb-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    This returns the characters at indexes 2, 3, and 4.\n</p>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-4 mb-2\">Slice from the Start</h3>\n\n<p class=\"mb-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    Leaving out the start index makes the slice begin at the beginning of the string.\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>text = \"Hello, World!\"\n\nprint(text[:5])</code></pre>\n\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-4 mb-2\">Slice to the End</h3>\n\n<p class=\"mb-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    Leaving out the end index makes the slice continue to the end of the string.\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>text = \"Hello, World!\"\n\nprint(text[2:])</code></pre>\n\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-4 mb-2\">Negative Indexing</h3>\n\n<p class=\"mb-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    Negative indexes start from the end of the string. The last character has an index of <code>-1</code>.\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>text = \"Hello, World!\"\n\nprint(text[-5:-2])</code></pre>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"my-4 p-4 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 dark:bg-amber-950/40 border-l-4 border-amber-500 text-amber-900 dark:text-amber-200 text-sm\">\n    <strong class=\"font-bold flex items-center gap-1.5 mb-1\">\n        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-lightbulb\"></i> Remember:\n    </strong>\n    In a slice, the character at the end position is not included.\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-6 mb-3\">Modifying Strings</h2>\n\n<p class=\"mb-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    Python provides built-in string methods for creating modified versions of strings.\n    String methods return a new string rather than changing the original string.\n</p>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-4 mb-2\">Upper Case</h3>\n\n<p class=\"mb-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    The <code>upper()</code> method converts letters to uppercase.\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>text = \"Hello, World!\"\n\nprint(text.upper())</code></pre>\n\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-4 mb-2\">Lower Case</h3>\n\n<p class=\"mb-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    The <code>lower()</code> method converts letters to lowercase.\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>text = \"Hello, World!\"\n\nprint(text.lower())</code></pre>\n\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-4 mb-2\">Remove Whitespace</h3>\n\n<p class=\"mb-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    The <code>strip()</code> method removes whitespace from the beginning and end of a string.\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>text = \"  Hello, World!  \"\n\nprint(text.strip())</code></pre>\n\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-4 mb-2\">Replace Text</h3>\n\n<p class=\"mb-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    The <code>replace()</code> method replaces one piece of text with another.\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>text = \"Hello, World!\"\n\nprint(text.replace(\"H\", \"J\"))</code></pre>\n\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-4 mb-2\">Split a String</h3>\n\n<p class=\"mb-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    The <code>split()</code> method divides a string into a list using a separator.\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>text = \"Hello, World!\"\n\nprint(text.split(\",\"))</code></pre>\n\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-6 mb-3\">Concatenating Strings</h2>\n\n<p class=\"mb-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    Concatenation means combining two or more strings. Python uses the <code>+</code> operator\n    to concatenate strings.\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>first = \"Hello\"\nlast = \"World\"\n\nresult = first + last\n\nprint(result)</code></pre>\n\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"mb-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    You can add a space by concatenating a string containing a space.\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>first = \"Hello\"\nlast = \"World\"\n\nresult = first + \" \" + last\n\nprint(result)</code></pre>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"my-4 p-4 rounded-xl bg-rose-50 dark:bg-rose-950/40 border-l-4 border-rose-500 text-rose-900 dark:text-rose-200 text-sm\">\n    <strong class=\"font-bold flex items-center gap-1.5 mb-1\">\n        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-circle-exclamation\"></i> Important:\n    </strong>\n    You cannot directly concatenate a string and a number with <code>+</code>.\n    Convert the number to a string or use string formatting.\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>age = 15\n\ntext = \"I am \" + str(age) + \" years old\"\n\nprint(text)</code></pre>\n\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-6 mb-3\">Format Strings</h2>\n\n<p class=\"mb-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    String formatting allows values such as numbers and variables to be inserted into strings.\n    Python provides f-strings and the <code>format()</code> method.\n</p>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-4 mb-2\">F-Strings</h3>\n\n<p class=\"mb-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    An f-string is created by placing an <code>f</code> before the string. Variables and expressions\n    can then be placed inside curly braces <code>{}</code>.\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>age = 15\n\ntext = f\"I am {age} years old\"\n\nprint(text)</code></pre>\n\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-4 mb-2\">Placeholders</h3>\n\n<p class=\"mb-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    A placeholder can contain a variable.\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>price = 59\n\ntext = f\"The price is {price} dollars\"\n\nprint(text)</code></pre>\n\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"mb-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    A placeholder can also contain an expression or Python code.\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>text = f\"The result is {20 * 5}\"\n\nprint(text)</code></pre>\n\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-4 mb-2\">Formatting Values</h3>\n\n<p class=\"mb-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    A colon inside a placeholder can be used with a formatting specification.\n    For example, <code>:.2f</code> displays a floating-point value with two decimal places.\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>price = 59\n\ntext = f\"The price is {price:.2f} dollars\"\n\nprint(text)</code></pre>\n\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-4 mb-2\">The format() Method</h3>\n\n<p class=\"mb-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    The <code>format()</code> method inserts values into placeholders marked with curly brackets.\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>age = 15\n\ntext = \"I am {} years old\"\n\nprint(text.format(age))</code></pre>\n\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-4 mb-2\">Multiple Placeholders</h3>\n\n<p class=\"mb-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    Multiple values can be inserted into multiple placeholders.\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>quantity = 3\nitem = 567\nprice = 49.95\n\norder = \"I want {} pieces of item {} for {} pounds.\"\n\nprint(order.format(quantity, item, price))</code></pre>\n\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-4 mb-2\">Numbered Placeholders</h3>\n\n<p class=\"mb-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    Numbered placeholders can specify exactly which argument should be inserted.\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>quantity = 3\nitem = 567\nprice = 49.95\n\norder = \"I want to pay {2} pounds for {0} pieces of item {1}.\"\n\nprint(order.format(quantity, item, price))</code></pre>\n\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-4 mb-2\">Named Placeholders</h3>\n\n<p class=\"mb-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    Named placeholders can be used to make formatted strings easier to understand.\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>name = \"John\"\nage = 36\n\ntext = \"My name is {fname}, and I am {age}.\"\nprint(text.format(fname=name, age=age))</code></pre>\n\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-6 mb-3\">Escape Characters</h2>\n\n<p class=\"mb-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    An escape character allows special characters to be placed inside strings.\n    An escape sequence begins with a backslash <code>\\</code>.\n</p>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-4 mb-2\">Escaping Double Quotes</h3>\n\n<p class=\"mb-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    A double quote inside a string surrounded by double quotes needs to be escaped.\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>text = \"He said \\\"Hello\\\"\"\n\nprint(text)</code></pre>\n\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-4 mb-2\">Common Escape Sequences</h3>\n\n<div class=\"overflow-x-auto\">\n    <table class=\"w-full text-sm border-collapse\">\n        <thead>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700\">\n                <th class=\"text-left py-2 px-3\">Escape</th>\n                <th class=\"text-left py-2 px-3\">Meaning</th>\n            </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>\\'</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Single quote</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>\\\"</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Double quote</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>\\\\</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Backslash</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>\\n</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">New line</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>\\r</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Carriage return</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>\\t</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Tab</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>\\b</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Backspace</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>\\f</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Form feed</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>\\ooo</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Octal value</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>\\xhh</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Hexadecimal value</td>\n            </tr>\n        </tbody>\n    </table>\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-4 mb-2\">New Lines and Tabs</h3>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>print(\"Hello\\nWorld\")\nprint(\"Name:\\tMichael\")</code></pre>\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-6 mb-3\">String Methods</h2>\n\n<p class=\"mb-3 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    Python provides many built-in methods for working with strings. String methods are called\n    using dot notation, such as <code>text.upper()</code>.\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"my-4 p-4 rounded-xl bg-emerald-50 dark:bg-emerald-950/40 border-l-4 border-emerald-500 text-emerald-900 dark:text-emerald-200 text-sm\">\n    <strong class=\"font-bold flex items-center gap-1.5 mb-1\">\n        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-lightbulb\"></i> Important:\n    </strong>\n    String methods return new values. They do not change the original string.\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-4 mb-2\">Case and Formatting Methods</h3>\n\n<div class=\"overflow-x-auto\">\n    <table class=\"w-full text-sm border-collapse\">\n        <thead>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700\">\n                <th class=\"text-left py-2 px-3\">Method</th>\n                <th class=\"text-left py-2 px-3\">Purpose</th>\n            </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>capitalize()</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Makes the first character uppercase.</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>casefold()</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Converts a string to a case-insensitive lowercase form.</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>center()</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Returns a centered version of the string.</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>ljust()</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Returns a left-justified string.</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>lower()</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Converts the string to lowercase.</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>rjust()</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Returns a right-justified string.</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>swapcase()</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Swaps uppercase characters to lowercase and lowercase characters to uppercase.</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>upper()</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Converts the string to uppercase.</td>\n            </tr>\n        </tbody>\n    </table>\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-4 mb-2\">Searching and Counting Methods</h3>\n\n<div class=\"overflow-x-auto\">\n    <table class=\"w-full text-sm border-collapse\">\n        <thead>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700\">\n                <th class=\"text-left py-2 px-3\">Method</th>\n                <th class=\"text-left py-2 px-3\">Purpose</th>\n            </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>count()</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Counts occurrences of a specified value.</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>endswith()</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Checks whether a string ends with a specified value.</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>find()</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Finds a value and returns its position.</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>index()</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Finds a value and returns its position.</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>rfind()</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Finds the last occurrence of a value and returns its position.</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>rindex()</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Finds the last occurrence of a value and returns its position.</td>\n            </tr>\n        </tbody>\n    </table>\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-4 mb-2\">Checking String Contents</h3>\n\n<div class=\"overflow-x-auto\">\n    <table class=\"w-full text-sm border-collapse\">\n        <thead>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700\">\n                <th class=\"text-left py-2 px-3\">Method</th>\n                <th class=\"text-left py-2 px-3\">Purpose</th>\n            </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>isalnum()</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Checks whether all characters are alphanumeric.</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>isalpha()</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Checks whether all characters are alphabetic.</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>isascii()</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Checks whether all characters are ASCII characters.</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>isdecimal()</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Checks whether all characters are decimal characters.</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>isdigit()</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Checks whether all characters are digits.</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>isidentifier()</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Checks whether the string is a valid identifier.</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>islower()</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Checks whether all cased characters are lowercase.</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>isnumeric()</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Checks whether all characters are numeric.</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>isprintable()</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Checks whether all characters are printable.</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>isspace()</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Checks whether all characters are whitespace.</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>istitle()</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Checks whether the string follows title-case rules.</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>isupper()</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Checks whether all cased characters are uppercase.</td>\n            </tr>\n        </tbody>\n    </table>\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-4 mb-2\">Splitting, Joining, and Replacing</h3>\n\n<div class=\"overflow-x-auto\">\n    <table class=\"w-full text-sm border-collapse\">\n        <thead>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700\">\n                <th class=\"text-left py-2 px-3\">Method</th>\n                <th class=\"text-left py-2 px-3\">Purpose</th>\n            </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>join()</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Combines elements of an iterable into one string.</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>partition()</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Splits a string into three parts around a separator.</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>replace()</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Replaces one value with another.</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>rpartition()</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Splits a string into three parts using the last matching separator.</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>rsplit()</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Splits a string from the right and returns a list.</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>split()</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Splits a string using a separator and returns a list.</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>splitlines()</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Splits a string at line boundaries and returns a list.</td>\n            </tr>\n        </tbody>\n    </table>\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-4 mb-2\">Whitespace and Alignment</h3>\n\n<div class=\"overflow-x-auto\">\n    <table class=\"w-full text-sm border-collapse\">\n        <thead>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700\">\n                <th class=\"text-left py-2 px-3\">Method</th>\n                <th class=\"text-left py-2 px-3\">Purpose</th>\n            </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>expandtabs()</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Sets the size of tab characters.</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>lstrip()</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Removes leading whitespace.</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>rstrip()</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Removes trailing whitespace.</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>strip()</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Removes leading and trailing whitespace.</td>\n            </tr>\n        </tbody>\n    </table>\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-4 mb-2\">Formatting and Translation Methods</h3>\n\n<div class=\"overflow-x-auto\">\n    <table class=\"w-full text-sm border-collapse\">\n        <thead>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700\">\n                <th class=\"text-left py-2 px-3\">Method</th>\n                <th class=\"text-left py-2 px-3\">Purpose</th>\n            </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>encode()</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Returns an encoded version of the string.</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>format()</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Formats specified values into a string.</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>format_map()</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Formats values using a mapping such as a dictionary.</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>maketrans()</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Creates a translation table for use with <code>translate()</code>.</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>translate()</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Returns a translated version of the string.</td>\n            </tr>\n        </tbody>\n    </table>\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-4 mb-2\">Zero Padding</h3>\n\n<div class=\"overflow-x-auto\">\n    <table class=\"w-full text-sm border-collapse\">\n        <thead>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700\">\n                <th class=\"text-left py-2 px-3\">Method</th>\n                <th class=\"text-left py-2 px-3\">Purpose</th>\n            </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n            <tr>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>zfill()</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Adds zeros to the beginning of the string until it reaches the requested width.</td>\n            </tr>\n        </tbody>\n    </table>\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-6 mb-3\">String Method Examples</h2>\n\n<p class=\"mb-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    Here are some common string methods in use.\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>text = \"hello world\"\n\nprint(text.capitalize())\nprint(text.upper())\nprint(text.title())</code></pre>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>text = \"banana\"\n\nprint(text.count(\"a\"))\nprint(text.find(\"n\"))\nprint(text.startswith(\"ban\"))\nprint(text.endswith(\"ana\"))</code></pre>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>text = \"Python\"\n\nprint(text.isalpha())\nprint(text.isalnum())\nprint(text.isupper())\nprint(text.islower())</code></pre>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>words = [\"Python\", \"is\", \"powerful\"]\n\nresult = \" \".join(words)\n\nprint(result)</code></pre>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>text = \"Hello World\"\n\nprint(text.replace(\"World\", \"Python\"))</code></pre>\n\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-6 mb-3\">Complete String Method Reference</h2>\n\n<p class=\"mb-3 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    The following is the complete string-method list covered by the W3Schools Python String Methods reference.\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"overflow-x-auto\">\n    <table class=\"w-full text-sm border-collapse\">\n        <thead>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700\">\n                <th class=\"text-left py-2 px-3\">Method</th>\n                <th class=\"text-left py-2 px-3\">Description</th>\n            </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>capitalize()</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Converts the first character to uppercase.</td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>casefold()</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Converts a string to a lowercase case-insensitive form.</td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>center()</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Returns a centered string.</td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>count()</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Counts how many times a value occurs.</td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>encode()</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Returns an encoded version of the string.</td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>endswith()</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Checks whether the string ends with a specified value.</td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>expandtabs()</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Sets the tab size.</td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>find()</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Searches for a value and returns its position.</td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>format()</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Formats specified values into a string.</td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>format_map()</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Formats values supplied through a mapping.</td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>index()</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Searches for a value and returns its position.</td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>isalnum()</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Checks whether all characters are alphanumeric.</td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>isalpha()</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Checks whether all characters are alphabetic.</td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>isascii()</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Checks whether all characters are ASCII characters.</td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>isdecimal()</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Checks whether all characters are decimal characters.</td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>isdigit()</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Checks whether all characters are digits.</td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>isidentifier()</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Checks whether the string is a valid identifier.</td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>islower()</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Checks whether all cased characters are lowercase.</td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>isnumeric()</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Checks whether all characters are numeric.</td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>isprintable()</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Checks whether all characters are printable.</td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>isspace()</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Checks whether all characters are whitespace.</td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>istitle()</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Checks whether the string follows title-case rules.</td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>isupper()</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Checks whether all cased characters are uppercase.</td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>join()</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Combines iterable elements into a string.</td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>ljust()</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Returns a left-justified string.</td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>lower()</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Converts the string to lowercase.</td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>lstrip()</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Removes characters or whitespace from the left side.</td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>maketrans()</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Creates a translation table.</td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>partition()</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Splits the string into three parts around a separator.</td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>replace()</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Replaces one value with another.</td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>rfind()</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Finds the last occurrence of a value.</td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>rindex()</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Finds the last occurrence of a value and returns its position.</td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>rjust()</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Returns a right-justified string.</td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>rpartition()</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Splits the string into three parts using the last separator.</td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>rsplit()</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Splits the string from the right and returns a list.</td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>rstrip()</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Removes characters or whitespace from the right side.</td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>split()</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Splits the string using a separator and returns a list.</td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>splitlines()</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Splits the string at line boundaries.</td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>startswith()</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Checks whether the string starts with a specified value.</td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>strip()</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Removes characters or whitespace from both ends.</td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>swapcase()</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Swaps uppercase and lowercase characters.</td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>title()</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Converts the first character of each word to uppercase.</td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>translate()</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Returns a translated version of the string.</td></tr>\n            <tr><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>upper()</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Converts the string to uppercase.</td></tr>\n            <tr><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>zfill()</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Pads the beginning of the string with zeros.</td></tr>\n        </tbody>\n    </table>\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-6 mb-3\">Common String Techniques</h2>\n\n<p class=\"mb-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    The following patterns combine several string features together.\n</p>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-4 mb-2\">Access and Slice</h3>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>text = \"Cybersecurity\"\n\nprint(text[0])\nprint(text[0:5])\nprint(text[-1])</code></pre>\n\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-4 mb-2\">Search a String</h3>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>log = \"Failed login from 192.168.1.10\"\n\nif \"Failed login\" in log:\nprint(\"Failed login detected.\")</code></pre>\n\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-4 mb-2\">Clean User Input</h3>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>username = input(\"Username: \")\n\nusername = username.strip().lower()\n\nprint(username)</code></pre>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"my-4 p-4 rounded-xl bg-emerald-50 dark:bg-emerald-950/40 border-l-4 border-emerald-500 text-emerald-900 dark:text-emerald-200 text-sm\">\n    <strong class=\"font-bold flex items-center gap-1.5 mb-1\">\n        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-shield-halved\"></i> Cybersecurity Connection:\n    </strong>\n    Strings are used constantly in cybersecurity for processing usernames, paths, URLs, HTTP data,\n    log messages, file contents, commands, headers, and other text-based data.\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-6 mb-3\">Quick Reference</h2>\n\n<div class=\"overflow-x-auto\">\n    <table class=\"w-full text-sm border-collapse\">\n        <thead>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700\">\n                <th class=\"text-left py-2 px-3\">Task</th>\n                <th class=\"text-left py-2 px-3\">Python</th>\n            </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Create a string</td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>\"Hello\"</code></td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Access a character</td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>text[0]</code></td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Slice a string</td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>text[2:5]</code></td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Get length</td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>len(text)</code></td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Check for text</td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>\"abc\" in text</code></td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Uppercase</td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>text.upper()</code></td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Lowercase</td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>text.lower()</code></td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Remove outer whitespace</td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>text.strip()</code></td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Replace text</td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>text.replace(\"a\", \"b\")</code></td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Split text</td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>text.split(\",\")</code></td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Join strings</td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>\" \".join(items)</code></td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Concatenate</td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>first + last</code></td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Format with f-string</td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>f\"Hello {name}\"</code></td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Escape a character</td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>\\\"</code>, <code>\\n</code>, <code>\\t</code></td>\n            </tr>\n        </tbody>\n    </table>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"my-4 p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 border-l-4 border-slate-500 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200 text-sm\">\n    <strong class=\"font-bold\">Key takeaway:</strong>\n    Python strings are sequences of characters. You should understand indexing, slicing, searching,\n    string modification, concatenation, formatting, escape sequences, and the built-in string methods.\n</div>\n"
