    "title": "Operators",
    "content": "<p class=\"text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    Operators are used to perform operations on variables and values. Python has several groups of\n    operators for performing mathematical calculations, assigning values, comparing values,\n    combining conditions, checking object identity, checking membership, and working with binary numbers.\n</p>\n\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-6 mb-3\">Operator Groups</h2>\n\n<ul class=\"list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    <li>Arithmetic operators</li>\n    <li>Assignment operators</li>\n    <li>Ternary operator</li>\n    <li>Comparison operators</li>\n    <li>Logical operators</li>\n    <li>Identity operators</li>\n    <li>Membership operators</li>\n    <li>Bitwise operators</li>\n    <li>Operator precedence</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-6 mb-3\">Arithmetic Operators</h2>\n\n<p class=\"mb-3 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    Arithmetic operators are used with numeric values to perform common mathematical operations.\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"overflow-x-auto\">\n    <table class=\"w-full text-sm border-collapse\">\n        <thead>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700\">\n                <th class=\"text-left py-2 px-3\">Operator</th>\n                <th class=\"text-left py-2 px-3\">Name</th>\n                <th class=\"text-left py-2 px-3\">Example</th>\n            </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>+</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Addition</td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>x + y</code></td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>-</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Subtraction</td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>x - y</code></td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>*</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Multiplication</td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>x * y</code></td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>/</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Division</td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>x / y</code></td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>%</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Modulus</td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>x % y</code></td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>**</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Exponentiation</td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>x ** y</code></td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>//</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Floor division</td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>x // y</code></td>\n            </tr>\n        </tbody>\n    </table>\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-4 mb-2\">Addition</h3>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>x = 10\ny = 5\n\nprint(x + y)</code></pre>\n\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-4 mb-2\">Subtraction</h3>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>x = 10\ny = 5\n\nprint(x - y)</code></pre>\n\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-4 mb-2\">Multiplication</h3>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>x = 10\ny = 5\n\nprint(x * y)</code></pre>\n\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-4 mb-2\">Division</h3>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>x = 10\ny = 4\n\nprint(x / y)</code></pre>\n\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-4 mb-2\">Modulus</h3>\n\n<p class=\"mb-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    The modulus operator <code>%</code> returns the remainder after division.\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>print(10 % 3)</code></pre>\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-4 mb-2\">Exponentiation</h3>\n\n<p class=\"mb-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    The <code>**</code> operator raises one number to the power of another.\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>print(2 ** 3)</code></pre>\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-4 mb-2\">Floor Division</h3>\n\n<p class=\"mb-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    The <code>//</code> operator divides two values and rounds the result down to the nearest whole number.\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>print(10 // 3)</code></pre>\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-6 mb-3\">Assignment Operators</h2>\n\n<p class=\"mb-3 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    Assignment operators are used to assign values to variables or update an existing variable.\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"overflow-x-auto\">\n    <table class=\"w-full text-sm border-collapse\">\n        <thead>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700\">\n                <th class=\"text-left py-2 px-3\">Operator</th>\n                <th class=\"text-left py-2 px-3\">Example</th>\n                <th class=\"text-left py-2 px-3\">Same As</th>\n            </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>=</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>x = 5</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>x = 5</code></td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>+=</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>x += 3</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>x = x + 3</code></td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>-=</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>x -= 3</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>x = x - 3</code></td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>*=</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>x *= 3</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>x = x * 3</code></td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>/=</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>x /= 3</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>x = x / 3</code></td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>%=</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>x %= 3</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>x = x % 3</code></td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>//=</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>x //= 3</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>x = x // 3</code></td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>**=</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>x **= 3</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>x = x ** 3</code></td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>&amp;=</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>x &amp;= 3</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>x = x &amp; 3</code></td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>|=</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>x |= 3</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>x = x | 3</code></td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>^=</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>x ^= 3</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>x = x ^ 3</code></td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>&gt;&gt;=</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>x &gt;&gt;= 3</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>x = x &gt;&gt; 3</code></td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>&lt;&lt;=</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>x &lt;&lt;= 3</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>x = x &lt;&lt; 3</code></td></tr>\n            <tr><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>:=</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>x := 3</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Assigns as part of an expression</td></tr>\n        </tbody>\n    </table>\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-4 mb-2\">Basic Assignment</h3>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>x = 5\n\nprint(x)</code></pre>\n\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-4 mb-2\">Compound Assignment</h3>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>x = 10\n\nx += 5\nprint(x)\n\nx -= 3\nprint(x)\n\nx *= 2\nprint(x)</code></pre>\n\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-4 mb-2\">The Walrus Operator :=</h3>\n\n<p class=\"mb-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    The <code>:=</code> operator is known as the walrus operator. It allows a value to be assigned\n    to a variable as part of a larger expression. W3Schools notes that it was introduced in Python 3.8.\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>numbers = [1, 2, 3, 4, 5]\n\nif (count := len(numbers)) > 3:\nprint(f\"List has {count} elements\")</code></pre>\n\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-6 mb-3\">Ternary Operator</h2>\n\n<p class=\"mb-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    The ternary expression allows you to choose one value when a condition is true and another value\n    when the condition is false.\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>num = 6\n\nx = \"WEEKEND!\" if num > 5 else \"Workday\"\n\nprint(x)</code></pre>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"my-4 p-4 rounded-xl bg-amber-50 dark:bg-amber-950/40 border-l-4 border-amber-500 text-amber-900 dark:text-amber-200 text-sm\">\n    <strong class=\"font-bold flex items-center gap-1.5 mb-1\">\n        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-lightbulb\"></i> Note:\n    </strong>\n    W3Schools notes that the ternary operator is not technically an operator. It is a conditional\n    expression, also commonly called a shorthand <code>if</code> statement.\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-4 mb-2\">Ternary Instead of elif</h3>\n\n<p class=\"mb-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    Multiple conditional expressions can be chained together.\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>num = 6\n\nx = \"Fri\" if num == 5 else \"Sat\" if num == 6 else \"Sun\" if num == 7 else \"weekday\"\n\nprint(x)</code></pre>\n\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-6 mb-3\">Comparison Operators</h2>\n\n<p class=\"mb-3 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    Comparison operators are used to compare two values. They return either <code>True</code> or <code>False</code>.\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"overflow-x-auto\">\n    <table class=\"w-full text-sm border-collapse\">\n        <thead>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700\">\n                <th class=\"text-left py-2 px-3\">Operator</th>\n                <th class=\"text-left py-2 px-3\">Name</th>\n                <th class=\"text-left py-2 px-3\">Example</th>\n            </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>==</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Equal</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>x == y</code></td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>!=</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Not equal</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>x != y</code></td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>&gt;</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Greater than</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>x &gt; y</code></td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>&lt;</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Less than</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>x &lt; y</code></td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>&gt;=</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Greater than or equal to</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>x &gt;= y</code></td></tr>\n            <tr><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>&lt;=</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Less than or equal to</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>x &lt;= y</code></td></tr>\n        </tbody>\n    </table>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>x = 5\ny = 3\n\nprint(x == y)\nprint(x != y)\nprint(x > y)\nprint(x < y)\nprint(x >= y)\nprint(x <= y)</code></pre>\n\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-4 mb-2\">Chaining Comparison Operators</h3>\n\n<p class=\"mb-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    Python allows comparison operators to be chained together.\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>x = 5\n\nprint(1 < x < 10)\nprint(1 < x and x < 10)</code></pre>\n\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-6 mb-3\">Logical Operators</h2>\n\n<p class=\"mb-3 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    Logical operators are used to combine conditional statements.\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"overflow-x-auto\">\n    <table class=\"w-full text-sm border-collapse\">\n        <thead>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700\">\n                <th class=\"text-left py-2 px-3\">Operator</th>\n                <th class=\"text-left py-2 px-3\">Description</th>\n                <th class=\"text-left py-2 px-3\">Example</th>\n            </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>and</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">True if both conditions are true</td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>x &lt; 5 and x &lt; 10</code></td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>or</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">True if at least one condition is true</td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>x &lt; 5 or x &lt; 4</code></td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>not</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Reverses the result</td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>not(x &lt; 5 and x &lt; 10)</code></td>\n            </tr>\n        </tbody>\n    </table>\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-4 mb-2\">and</h3>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>x = 5\n\nprint(x > 0 and x < 10)</code></pre>\n\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-4 mb-2\">or</h3>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>x = 5\n\nprint(x < 5 or x > 10)</code></pre>\n\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-4 mb-2\">not</h3>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>x = 5\n\nprint(not(x > 3 and x < 10))</code></pre>\n\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-6 mb-3\">Identity Operators</h2>\n\n<p class=\"mb-3 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    Identity operators compare whether two variables refer to the same object, rather than simply\n    checking whether their values are equal.\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"overflow-x-auto\">\n    <table class=\"w-full text-sm border-collapse\">\n        <thead>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700\">\n                <th class=\"text-left py-2 px-3\">Operator</th>\n                <th class=\"text-left py-2 px-3\">Description</th>\n                <th class=\"text-left py-2 px-3\">Example</th>\n            </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>is</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">True when both variables refer to the same object</td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>x is y</code></td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>is not</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">True when both variables do not refer to the same object</td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>x is not y</code></td>\n            </tr>\n        </tbody>\n    </table>\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-4 mb-2\">is vs ==</h3>\n\n<p class=\"mb-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    <code>is</code> checks object identity, while <code>==</code> checks whether values are equal.\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>x = [\"apple\", \"banana\"]\ny = [\"apple\", \"banana\"]\nz = x\n\nprint(x is z)\nprint(x is y)\nprint(x == y)</code></pre>\n\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-4 mb-2\">is not</h3>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>x = [\"apple\", \"banana\"]\ny = [\"apple\", \"banana\"]\n\nprint(x is not y)</code></pre>\n\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-6 mb-3\">Membership Operators</h2>\n\n<p class=\"mb-3 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    Membership operators test whether a specified value is present in an object or sequence.\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"overflow-x-auto\">\n    <table class=\"w-full text-sm border-collapse\">\n        <thead>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700\">\n                <th class=\"text-left py-2 px-3\">Operator</th>\n                <th class=\"text-left py-2 px-3\">Description</th>\n                <th class=\"text-left py-2 px-3\">Example</th>\n            </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>in</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">True when the specified value is present</td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>x in y</code></td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>not in</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">True when the specified value is not present</td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>x not in y</code></td>\n            </tr>\n        </tbody>\n    </table>\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-4 mb-2\">in with Lists</h3>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>fruits = [\"apple\", \"banana\", \"cherry\"]\n\nprint(\"banana\" in fruits)</code></pre>\n\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-4 mb-2\">not in with Lists</h3>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>fruits = [\"apple\", \"banana\", \"cherry\"]\n\nprint(\"pineapple\" not in fruits)</code></pre>\n\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-4 mb-2\">Membership in Strings</h3>\n\n<p class=\"mb-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    Membership operators can also be used with strings.\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>text = \"Hello World\"\n\nprint(\"H\" in text)\nprint(\"hello\" in text)\nprint(\"z\" not in text)</code></pre>\n\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-6 mb-3\">Bitwise Operators</h2>\n\n<p class=\"mb-3 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    Bitwise operators work with the binary representation of numbers.\n    They operate on individual bits.\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"overflow-x-auto\">\n    <table class=\"w-full text-sm border-collapse\">\n        <thead>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700\">\n                <th class=\"text-left py-2 px-3\">Operator</th>\n                <th class=\"text-left py-2 px-3\">Name</th>\n                <th class=\"text-left py-2 px-3\">Description</th>\n                <th class=\"text-left py-2 px-3\">Example</th>\n            </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>&amp;</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">AND</td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Sets each bit to 1 if both bits are 1</td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>x &amp; y</code></td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>|</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">OR</td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Sets each bit to 1 if either bit is 1</td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>x | y</code></td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>^</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">XOR</td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Sets each bit to 1 if only one bit is 1</td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>x ^ y</code></td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>~</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">NOT</td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Inverts all the bits</td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>~x</code></td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>&lt;&lt;</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Left shift</td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Shifts bits to the left</td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>x &lt;&lt; 2</code></td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>&gt;&gt;</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Right shift</td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Shifts bits to the right</td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>x &gt;&gt; 2</code></td>\n            </tr>\n        </tbody>\n    </table>\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-4 mb-2\">Bitwise AND</h3>\n\n<p class=\"mb-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    Each bit is set to 1 only when both corresponding bits are 1.\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>print(6 &amp; 3)</code></pre>\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"mb-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    In binary:\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3\">\n    <pre><code>6 = 0110\n3 = 0011\n    ----\n    0010 = 2</code></pre>\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-4 mb-2\">Bitwise OR</h3>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>print(6 | 3)</code></pre>\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"mb-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    In binary:\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3\">\n    <pre><code>6 = 0110\n3 = 0011\n    ----\n    0111 = 7</code></pre>\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-4 mb-2\">Bitwise XOR</h3>\n\n<p class=\"mb-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    XOR sets a bit to 1 when exactly one of the two corresponding bits is 1.\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>print(6 ^ 3)</code></pre>\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"mb-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    In binary:\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3\">\n    <pre><code>6 = 0110\n3 = 0011\n    ----\n    0101 = 5</code></pre>\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-4 mb-2\">Bitwise NOT</h3>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>x = 5\n\nprint(~x)</code></pre>\n\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-4 mb-2\">Left Shift</h3>\n\n<p class=\"mb-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    The left-shift operator moves bits to the left and shifts zeros in from the right.\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>print(5 &lt;&lt; 2)</code></pre>\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-4 mb-2\">Right Shift</h3>\n\n<p class=\"mb-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    The right-shift operator moves bits to the right.\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>print(5 &gt;&gt; 2)</code></pre>\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-6 mb-3\">Operator Precedence</h2>\n\n<p class=\"mb-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    Operator precedence determines the order in which operations are performed.\n    Operators with higher precedence are evaluated before operators with lower precedence.\n</p>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-4 mb-2\">Parentheses First</h3>\n\n<p class=\"mb-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    Parentheses have the highest precedence in the W3Schools precedence table.\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>print((6 + 3) - (6 + 3))</code></pre>\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-4 mb-2\">Multiplication Before Addition</h3>\n\n<p class=\"mb-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    Multiplication has higher precedence than addition, so multiplication is performed first.\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>print(100 + 5 * 3)</code></pre>\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-4 mb-2\">Precedence Order</h3>\n\n<p class=\"mb-3 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    The following order starts with the highest precedence.\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"overflow-x-auto\">\n    <table class=\"w-full text-sm border-collapse\">\n        <thead>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700\">\n                <th class=\"text-left py-2 px-3\">Operator</th>\n                <th class=\"text-left py-2 px-3\">Description</th>\n            </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>()</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Parentheses</td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>**</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Exponentiation</td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>+x</code>, <code>-x</code>, <code>~x</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Unary plus, unary minus, and bitwise NOT</td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>*</code>, <code>/</code>, <code>//</code>, <code>%</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Multiplication, division, floor division, and modulus</td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>+</code>, <code>-</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Addition and subtraction</td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>&lt;&lt;</code>, <code>&gt;&gt;</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Bitwise left and right shifts</td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>&amp;</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Bitwise AND</td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>^</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Bitwise XOR</td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>|</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Bitwise OR</td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>==</code>, <code>!=</code>, <code>&gt;</code>, <code>&gt;=</code>, <code>&lt;</code>, <code>&lt;=</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Comparisons</td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>is</code>, <code>is not</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Identity</td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>in</code>, <code>not in</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Membership</td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>not</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Logical NOT</td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>and</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Logical AND</td></tr>\n            <tr><td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>or</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Logical OR</td></tr>\n        </tbody>\n    </table>\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-4 mb-2\">Left-to-Right Evaluation</h3>\n\n<p class=\"mb-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\">\n    When operators have the same precedence, W3Schools explains that the expression is evaluated from left to right.\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"bg-slate-900 text-slate-100 p-4 rounded-xl relative my-3 group\">\n    <button onclick=\"copyCode(this)\" class=\"absolute top-2.5 right-2.5 px-2 py-1 text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 rounded border border-slate-700\">\n        <i class=\"fa-regular fa-copy\"></i> Copy\n    </button>\n    <pre><code>print(5 + 4 - 7 + 3)</code></pre>\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-6 mb-3\">Quick Reference</h2>\n\n<div class=\"overflow-x-auto\">\n    <table class=\"w-full text-sm border-collapse\">\n        <thead>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700\">\n                <th class=\"text-left py-2 px-3\">Group</th>\n                <th class=\"text-left py-2 px-3\">Operators</th>\n                <th class=\"text-left py-2 px-3\">Main Purpose</th>\n            </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Arithmetic</td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>+ - * / % ** //</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Mathematical operations</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Assignment</td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>= += -= *= /= %= //= **=</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Assign and update variables</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Ternary</td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">conditional expression</td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Choose between two values</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Comparison</td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>== != &gt; &lt; &gt;= &lt;=</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Compare values</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Logical</td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>and or not</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Combine conditions</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Identity</td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>is is not</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Compare object identity</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\">\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Membership</td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>in not in</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Check whether a value is present</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Bitwise</td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\"><code>&amp; | ^ ~ &lt;&lt; &gt;&gt;</code></td>\n                <td class=\"py-2 px-3\">Work with binary bits</td>\n            </tr>\n        </tbody>\n    </table>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"my-4 p-4 rounded-xl bg-emerald-50 dark:bg-emerald-950/40 border-l-4 border-emerald-500 text-emerald-900 dark:text-emerald-200 text-sm\">\n    <strong class=\"font-bold flex items-center gap-1.5 mb-1\">\n        <i class=\"fa-solid fa-shield-halved\"></i> Cybersecurity Connection:\n    </strong>\n    Operators are fundamental in security programming. Arithmetic and assignment operators are used\n    for calculations and state changes, comparison and logical operators are used for conditions and\n    validation, membership operators are useful when checking data, and bitwise operators are\n    important when working with binary data and low-level systems.\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"my-4 p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 border-l-4 border-slate-500 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200 text-sm\">\n    <strong class=\"font-bold\">Key takeaway:</strong>\n    Learn what each operator does, but also learn <strong>when</strong> to use it.\n    In particular, understand the difference between <code>=</code> and <code>==</code>,\n    <code>==</code> and <code>is</code>, <code>and</code>/<code>or</code>/<code>not</code>,\n    and the bitwise operators.\n</div>\n"
